Clerks is a comedy film directed by Kevin Smith.

3
00:12:32,727 --> 00:12:38,727
Convenience and video store clerks Dante and Randal are
sharp-witted, potty-mouthed and bored out of their minds.

4
00:16:43,636 --> 00:16:49,636
So in between needling customers, the counter jockeys play hockey on the
roof, visit a funeral home and deal with their love lives.

5
